# ---------------------------------------------------------------- WgZ2Pre (0.7.6): the background landing pre-load (beta bug 4 lag part 4)
# kick(w) (any thread; cheap): skywynn_zones2 alive with our generator, not yet started for THIS world instance -> one daemon thread.
# run(): layout (off-thread) -> landing heights cached -> radius R from Server Setup -> the chunks around each landing that the storage
