# ---------------------------------------------------------------- WgWeather (0.7.1): the environment -> weather map of our worlds has no holes
# (the vanilla NPC SensorWeather NPE, see tools/worldgen_0_7_1_patch.py 1): default answer 0 = vanilla's "no weather"; environments the
