# Vanilla's tree (HytaleServer.jar 0.7.1): /spawn = node spawn.self + group Builder, /spawn <player> = node spawn.other (inherits the
# Builder group), /spawn set = group WorldEditor, /spawn default = group Admin (auto nodes). /spawn + /spawn <player> become admin-only
